Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/positional_tuple.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val p = (1, 2);
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0048]: Jet tuples name every member — positional `(1, 2)` isn't allowed (S73)
  --> tests/ui/positional_tuple.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     val p = (1, 2);
    |             ^
 Why: named members make field access obvious and avoid `.0`, which collides with decimal numbers
 Fix: write named members: `(x: 1, y: 2)` and use `p.x`, not `p.0`
